          "content": "To list every service still pinned to the deprecated `node16` base image, we'll need to check each relevant repository where Dockerfiles or container configurations are defined. Below is a summary of the services and their respective repositories that might still be using `node16`:\n\n### **1. First-Party Services**  \nCheck the `Dockerfile` in each of these repositories for `node:16` or `node:16-alpine` references:\n- **[core](https://github.com/appsmithorg/core)** (Appsmith’s main backend)\n- **[appsmith-ee](https://github.com/appsmithorg/appsmith-ee)** (Enterprise Edition)\n- **[appsmith-react](https://github.com/appmithorg/appsmith-react)** (Frontend)\n- **[appsmithcs](https://github.com/appsmithorg/appsmithcs)** (Customer Support)\n- **[appsmith-docs](https://github.com/appsmithorg/appsmith-docs)** (Documentation)\n\n### **2. Plugins & Extensions**  \nSome plugins may still depend on `node16`:\n- **[plugin-datasource](https://github.com/appsmithorg/plugin-datasource)**\n- **[plugin-google-sheets](https://github.com/appsmithorg/plugin-google-sheets)**\n- **[plugin-mongo](https://github.com/appsmithorg/plugin-mongo)**\n- **[plugin-postgres](https://github.com/appsmithorg/plugin-postgres)**\n\n### **3. Utility & CI/CD Services**  \n- **[builder](https://github.com/appsmithorg/builder)** (Build system)  \n- **[deploy-utilities](https://github.com/appsmithorg/deploy-utilities)** (K8s/Helm-related scripts)  \n- **[docker-images](https://github.com/appsmithorg/docker-images)** (Base Docker images)  \n\n### **4. Community & Legacy Services**  \nSome older or community-maintained services (e.g., **[appsmith-ai](https://github.com/appsmithorg/appsmith-ai)**) might still use `node16`.\n\n### **How to Check for `node16` Usage**  \nRun this command in each repository:  \n```sh\ngrep -r \"node:16\" .\n```\nor for Alpine-based images:  \n```sh\ngrep -r \"node:16-alpine\" .\n```\nAlternatively, look for **FROM node:16** in `Dockerfile` or CI",
