          "content": "Here's a polite and professional way to phrase your request:  \n\n**\"Could we split the order so the in-stock items ship now, and the out-of-stock items follow once available? I’d appreciate any flexibility to avoid delays.\"**  \n\n### Why this works:  \n- **Clear & concise** – Gets straight to the request.  \n- **Polite tone** – \"Could we\" and \"I’d appreciate\" maintain professionalism.  \n- **Solution-oriented** – Proposes a practical fix without demanding.  \n\nIf you need it more urgent, you could adjust:  \n*\"If possible, I’d like to split the order to receive available items now—please let me know if this is an option. Thanks for your help!\"*  \n\nLet me know if you'd like further tweaks!",
