  "span_ed1357c818": {
    "span_id": "span_ed1357c818",
    "prompt": "Do you ship to the Channel Islands, and what are the customs charges?",
    "response": "Yes, we do ship to the **Channel Islands** (Jersey, Guernsey, Alderney, and Sark). However, since the Channel Islands are outside the UK VAT area but within the **UK Customs Territory**, **customs charges** may apply depending on the value of your order.  \n\n### **Customs & Import Charges**  \n1. **Orders under £135 (£60 for Alderney & Sark)**:  \n   - No VAT is collected at checkout (unless applicable UK VAT was already included).  \n   - Local customs may impose **import VAT (GST) and duties**, which the recipient is responsible for paying upon delivery.  \n\n2. **Orders over £135 (£60 for Alderney & Sark)**:  \n   - UK VAT is **not** charged at checkout.  \n   - The recipient will be responsible for **local import VAT (GST) and duties**, payable to the courier before delivery.  \n\n### **Additional Notes**  \n- **Jersey & Guernsey**: Typically apply **5% GST (Goods and Services Tax)** and possible duties depending on the item type.  \n- **Alderney & Sark**: May have separate thresholds and fees.  \n- **Courier fees**: Some carriers charge an additional **handling fee** for customs processing.  \n\nFor the most accurate estimate, you can check with the **local customs authority** in the specific island:  \n- **Jersey**: [Gov.je](https://www.gov.je/)  \n- **Guernsey**: [Gov.gg](https://www.gov.gg/)  \n\nWould you like a shipping cost estimate for your order? Let me know, and I’ll assist further! 😊",
    "args": null,
    "result": null
  },
